# Adjective closed-class bits (%include'd from sv.gram).
#
# Regular adjectives (stor, grön, ...) inflect via the Adj-reg paradigm in
# morph.gram (gender/number/definiteness agreement). This file holds what
# morphology can't derive: degree modifiers and indeclinable adjectives.

# Degree modifiers ("en mycket stor hund", "ett för stort hus").
mycket : Deg
för    : Deg
så     : Deg

# "bra" (good) is indeclinable: it never changes for gender/number/definiteness
# ("en bra hund", "ett bra hus", "de bra hundarna"). Leaving gender/num/strong
# unset lets it unify with any noun. Its comparison is suppletive (bättre/bäst).
# Future: regular comparative/superlative (-are/-ast) is not modelled yet.
bra    : Adj  <degree>=pos
bättre : Adj  <degree>=comp
bäst   : Adj  <degree>=sup
